WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.868
-Milo, you've acted
in all sorts of roles,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.770
and that means you're in touch
with so many emotions,

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.572
but I wanted to see
just how emotional we can get.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.408
It's time for
an Emotional Interview.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.809
Here we go.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.745
-♪ Emotional interview ♪

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.313
-Now, here's how it works.

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.382
We're gonna have a normal
conversation with each other,

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.452
except every so often we're
gonna hear this ding sound.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.686
[ Ding ]

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.788
And when we hear that,
we'll be given an emotion

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:26.092
or situation that we have to
act out as we keep talking.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.426
And you'll see it on the screen.

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:28.560
You'll see it
on your Zoom screen.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.696
Does that sound good?

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:30.864
-Yeah. Great.
-Okay. Good.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:31.998
-Sounds great.
-All right.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.533
So, the game's kind of starting.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.603
So, now, when the --
when the pandemic ends,

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:39.172
do you have any plans
for vacation?

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.174 line:0%
-[ Ding ]
-Do you have --

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.910 line:0%
-Oh, my God!
I'm gonna go everywhere!

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.111 line:0%
-Yeah! No! Me too, dude!
Oh, no, no, no!

00:00:46.111 --> 00:00:47.380 line:0%
No, no. Me, me!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.881 line:0%
-I'm gonna drive.
I'm gonna fly.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.883 line:0%
-I'm gonna fly. No.
I'm gonna drive. No. Yeah.

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.152 line:0%
That's right, yo!
I love flying! I love driving!

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.854 line:0%
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
-Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:57.190 line:0%
Let's go together!
-Let's do it, dude!

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.891 line:0%
We've got to!
-[ Ding ]

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.760 line:0%
-Bro!
-Uh...

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.662 line:0%
-So, really, it's like --
Sometimes I'm in boxers.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.330 line:0%
Sometimes I'm in briefs.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.731 line:0%
But really, like,
at other times,

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:07.733 line:0%
it's just, you know --
There's -- There's nothing.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.202 line:0%
I'm not wearing anything.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.770 line:0%
But look. Long story short.
Long story short.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.373 line:0%
-Yeah. Yeah, I know --

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.774 line:0%
-You wear what you need
in the moment...

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.409 line:0%
-You do.
-...because --

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.077 line:0%
In those moments, sometimes --

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:20.813 line:0%
-I used to wear --
My roommate who is --

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:23.349 line:0%
Well, he -- Long story short,
he's not my roommate anymore.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.084 line:0%
Uh, but --
-Wait. What happened?

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.252 line:0%
'Cause you guys were, like --

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.486 line:0%
You guys were really close
friends, right?

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:29.021 line:0%
You'd known each other
since you were in ki--

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:32.125 line:0%
I mean, it's a long story
made incredibly short for TV.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.460 line:0%
-[ Laughter ]
-[ Ding ]

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.195 line:0%
-"Made incredibly short."
I understand.

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:38.097 line:0%
Now, walk me through it again.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:41.967 line:0%
On TV, what that's like
to tell a short story, again.

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:43.770 line:0%
-Yes, sir. Yes, sir.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:48.041 line:0%
So -- So, sir, if you have
your television on...

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.509 line:0%
-Yeah. No, no, no.
I hear you. I hear you.

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.510 line:0%
-And it's set it to channel 4.
-I hear you. And I understand.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.479 line:0%
I understand. No. I totally --

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:54.780 line:0%
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.016 line:0%
Would you take a survey
at the end of this...?

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.184 line:0%
[ Ding ]

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.287 line:0%
Would you let people know
if I'm doing a good job?

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.556 line:0%
'Cause when I think --
[ Coughs ]

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.557 line:0%
-I'll take a survey.

00:02:05.557 --> 00:02:07.560 line:0%
I'll take a survey
just like I took the shrimp

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.028 line:0%
that I just took off my --

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.164 line:0%
[Muffled] There was a platter
of shrimp -- of shrimp.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:12.698 line:0%
-[Muffled]
Do you have an EpiPen?

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:15.268 line:0%
Do you have an EpiPen?
-There was a platter of shrimp.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.803 line:0%
There was a platter of shrimp
that I saw.

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:20.907 line:0%
And there was a survey.
But it was a platter of shrimp.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:22.541 line:0%
And I haven't had a shrimp.

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.210 line:0%
No! No!
-[ Ding ]

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.445 line:0%
-[Normal voice] Well, anyway,
we can talk about this tomorrow.

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:31.484 line:0%
And, uh -- It's a good --
Yeah. And thank you so much.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.519 line:0%
And, you know, I think we --
-[Normal voice] Yeah.

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:37.657 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.925 line:0%
Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.
It was -- It was great.

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:42.762 line:0%
I mean, listen. I'm always --
I'm so happy to be here.

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.831 line:0%
I'll be here next time.
It was great seeing you.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.165 line:0%
-Uh-huh. Yeah.
-Take care.

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.167 line:0%
-Oh, that's totally interesting.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.769 line:0%
And that's good.
Where's "leave meeting"?

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.937 line:0%
Uh, yeah.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.204 line:0%
[ Dinging ]

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:54.140 line:0%
I would never do that.
That's how you do it!

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.043 line:0%
That's how you get that statue!
That's my man right here!

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.178 line:0%
An emotional interview
with Milo Ventimiglia.

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:02.382 line:0%
"This Is Us" airs Tuesdays
at 9:00 pm on NBC.

